        <detaileddescription>
<para>allow to use different calibration (expert option)</para>
<para>This options allows to process raw data with a different calibration. this is, however, limited to the same hardware.</para>
<para>If the hardware was mechanically changed, results may be poor or not usable at all. Unless the accuracy of the result can be verified, this option is not recommended. </para>
